# teacher_app.apk / student_app.apk ARE committed on purpose - Render's free tier has no persistent
# disk or dashboard file upload, so the repo is the only place they can live for /downloads to serve.

# --- Flutter/Dart (applies under teacher_app/ and student_app/) ---
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.packages
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
**/*.iml
**/*.g.dart

# Android
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/captures/
**/android/gradlew
**/android/gradlew.bat
**/android/local.properties
**/android/**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
**/android/key.properties
**/*.jks

